<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analysts Rizwan Ali and C.A. Recouso on Wednesday started coverage of Venezuelan telephone company CANTV with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- In a report, they set a 12-month price target of $35, &quot;representing a 25 percent upside&quot; from current levels. CANTV is an acronym for Compania Anonima Nacional Telefonos de Venezuela.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were unchanged at 27-3/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
